rate the **summary** and the **step-by-step verification log** for the solution above. In your log, justify each correct step and explain in detail any errors or justification gaps you find, as specified in the instructions above.\n\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Return your verdict as JSON matching the provided schema.\n"
